'''Gary Gory''' (ガリゴリくん, '''''Garigori-kun''''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in [[Summer Break Cats|Summer Lesson]]. It was added in [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]].

