==Enemy==
Unlike other Gory variants, Gary Gory's attack power increases by 100% when he reaches half of his health. He also has surprisingly decent health.

==Strategy==
The best way to deal with it is to take it out quickly with strong attackers like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] or [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]], as killing it quickly will obviously minimize the amount of time it spends strengthened.

