==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Garigori-kun, is a reference to [[wikipedia:ja:ガリガリ君|Garigari-kun]], a Japanese ice confectionery brand.
*Prior to [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]], Gary Gory had Single Target instead of Area Attack.
*In the [[Media:Summervac 2024 img01-03 en.png|event poster]] for [[Summer Break Cats#Summer Lesson|Summer Lesson]], Gary Gory is referred to as Gory Junior, which was the only name he had until he was added to the [[Enemy Guide]] in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

